     "explanation": "Wallas's four-stage model and modern incubation research both support Konnikova's reading: Holmes's quiet, hands-occupied breaks come after the effortful preparation stage and function as incubation, letting background associative processing surface a candidate solution that conscious, focused effort had stalled on.",
